    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d499">

                <pb facs="0654" n="642" xml:id="pg642"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/7–246: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Truman to the British Prime Minister</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Attlee</hi>)<anchor n="94" xml:id="d499-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-07-02T19:00:00-04:00">July 2, 1946—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Replying to your message of June 28,<anchor n="95" xml:id="d499-f2"/> I join with
                    you in regretting that drastic action is considered necessary by the mandatory
                    government while discussions of the report of the Anglo-American Committee are
                    in progress. I also join with you in a hope that law and order will be
                    maintained by the inhabitants of Palestine while efforts are being made toward a
                    solution of the long term policy.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d499-f1" n="94" type="source" xml:id="d499-f1-content">
                <p>Sent to London as Department’s telegram 5150, with the instruction: “Kindly
                    transmit following message from the President to PriMin.”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d499-f2" n="95" xml:id="d499-f2-content">
                <p>See undated telegram, <ref target="#pg639">p. 639</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
